WEBVTT

00:11:28.992 --> 00:11:31.184
that she decided to challenge him.

00:11:31.505 --> 00:11:33.987
And you know what? She did, and she won,

00:11:34.011 --> 00:11:35.964
and when she goes to Congress in January,

00:11:35.988 --> 00:11:39.513
she'll be the first lesbian mother
serving in the House of Representatives.

00:11:39.537 --> 00:11:41.322
(Applause and cheers)

00:11:41.346 --> 00:11:42.517
Or --

00:11:42.541 --> 00:11:44.077
(Applause)

00:11:44.101 --> 00:11:46.870
Or Lauren Underwood from Illinois.

00:11:47.423 --> 00:11:49.108
She's a registered nurse,

00:11:49.132 --> 00:11:53.633
and she sees every day the impact
that lack of health care access has

00:11:53.657 --> 00:11:55.834
on the community where she lives,

00:11:55.858 --> 00:11:57.753
and so she decided to run.

00:11:57.777 --> 00:12:00.850
She took on six men in her primary,
she beat them all,